<title>UK: SOCCER-NEWCASTLE V ASTON VILLA SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEWCASTLE V ASTON VILLA SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Monday's English premier league match:</p>
<p>Newcastle 4 (Ferdinand 5th minute, 22nd, Shearer 38th, Howey 67th) Aston Villa 3 (Yorke 4th, 59th, 69th). Halftime 3-1. Attendance: 36,400.</p>
